{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@interface","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"PWRichMediaManager","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSObject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSObject"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Single delegate-gate invariant","anchor":"Single-delegate-gate-invariant"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentRichMedia:"},{"type":"text","text":" is the only place where "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWRichMediaPresentingDelegate.shouldPresentRichMedia:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"is checked. All upstream paths — push ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWInAppMessagesManager.presentRichMediaFromPush:"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"postEvent ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWInAppMessagesManager.postEvent:"},{"text":"), and the public manual APIs","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"PWModalRichMedia.presentRichMedia:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWLegacyRichMedia.presentRichMedia:"},{"type":"text","text":") — must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"route through this method. Downstream classes (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWModalWindow"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWMessageViewController"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWModalWindowConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":") do NOT re-check the delegate; they assume the gate"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already approved the presentation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Exception: native in-app resources (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"native-config.json"},{"type":"text","text":" in the ZIP) are routed to the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"PushwooshInApp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module at the top of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentRichMedia:"},{"text":", BEFORE the gate, and are","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intentionally NOT subject to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shouldPresentRichMedia:"},{"text":" — they carry their own lifecycle","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"callbacks (onShown\/onClicked\/onClosed). The gate governs HTML \/ modal rich media only.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwrichmediamanager"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"]]},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"type":"inheritsFrom"}],"metadata":{"title":"PWRichMediaManager","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PWRichMediaManager","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"PWRichMediaManager","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","externalID":"c:objc(cs)PWRichMediaManager"},"abstract":[{"code":"PWRichMediaManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the singleton entry point for all rich media presentation.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager\/delegate","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaManager\/richMediaStyle"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh